<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Gamo Geesha Maxxafa</book>
  <para style="h">1 Phixxirosa</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Phixxirosa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesus Kiristoosan kiitetida pixxirosape, Asa biittan beten dizaytas Phanxoosen, Galatiyan, Qepedooqiyan, Isiyanine Bitaniya biittan laaleti diza intes, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Aaway Xoossi kase intena erida mala dooretidaytas, Yesus Kiristoosas azazistanasine inte iza suuthan aracetidi geeyana mala xiillo ayanan dumattida intes kiyatethine sarotethi daro.</para>
  <para style="s">Gita hidota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesus Kiristoosay hayqope dendida gishshi nuusu deyo gidida ufayssi immidayssi ba gita maarotethan nuna bees ooratha nayta histidayss nu Goda Yesus Kiristoosa Aaway Xoossi galateto.<note caller="-" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kuriqunthan uttiza shuchu guus tuussa malakko</char></note> <verse number="4" style="v"/>Izi dhayontta, mooretonttane ceegontta laataso intes salon giigisi wothides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Inteka wursetha gallasan buro qonccana atotethas ammano geedon Xoossa wolqan naagetidista. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ha7i guutha wodes duma duma paaceti intena waayssikoka inte hessan ufa7ettite. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessi he paacezi inte bolla gakizay inte ammanozi tumu gididayssa qonccisanaskko. Dhayana worqayka taman paacettes. Worqape aadhi boncho gidida inte ammanoyka hessaththo paacistanas besses. Hessi he paacetida inte ammanoy Yesus Kiristoosay qoncciza gallas galatas, bonchosine sabas intena gaathana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Inte Yesus Kiristoosa ayfera beyontta aggikoka inte iza doosista. Ha7ika inte iza beyontta aggikoka iza ammaneta; Coo qaalan qonccisana danda7ontta gita boncho ufayss inte ufa7etista. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Inte naagiza inte shempoyss atoteth inte ammanon demmidista. <verse number="10" style="v"/>He atotethaza gishshi intes imistana kiyatethas kase nabeti lo7ethi wozinape pilig xeellida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kase isttan diza Kiristoosa ayanay Xoossafe tiyettidayssa bolla gakana waayezane he waayezape guye izi demmana bonchoza gishshi kase bessi wothides. Istti qass hessi wurikka ayide waani hananakone yuushi qopida. <verse number="12" style="v"/>He kase nabeti intes oothida attin istti bees oothonttayssi isttas qonccen erettides. Istti intes oothiday bolla salope kiitetida xiillo ayana baggara ha7i intes miishiracho qaala yootida asati intes yootidayssa qonccisanasikko. Hessa qaala kiitanchatika beyanas amottida.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossas dummati duus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi inte inte wozina suurisidi oothos giigetite. Wogara deyite. Yesus Kiristoosay qoncciza wode inte iza kiyatetha demmanas intes kumetha ufayssi deyo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Inte azazetiza nayta gididi erontta dishe inte kase intes diza iitta qofa kaallopite. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Intena xeeygida Xoossi duuma gidida mala inteka inte duussan wurson duumatite. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Gaasoyka “Tani duuma gidida gishshi inteka duuma gidite” geeteti geesha maxaafan kase xaafetides. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Oonaka duuma shaaki maadontta issa issas izade ootho mala piridiza Xoossa “Izi nu Aawakko” giidi inte xeeygizazi gidiko hayssa alamezan inte imathene bete asi gidi diza wode wurson izas babbite. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Inte kase inte Aawatape laatida coo mela hada duusafe wozettiday dhayiza biran woykko worqan gidonttayssa inte ereista. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Gido attin inte wozetiday iittayne wothoy iza bolla bayinda geesha dorisa mala gidida Kiristoosa boncho suuthankko. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Izi erettiday hayssi alamezi medhetanape kase gidishin ha7i qass wursetha woden intes qoncides. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Intes ammanoyne inte hidotay Xoossan gidana mala Yesus Kiristoosa baggara he iza hayqope denthidi izas booncho immida Xoossan inte ammanettista. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Inte ammanizayta suure wozinape siiqana mala tumas azazetethan inte inte asatetha geeshidista. Hessa gishshi inte inte giddon issay issara lo7ethi siiqettite. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Inte nam7antho yeelettiday medhinas minni diza dhayontta deyo Xoossa qaalan dhayontta zereththafe attin dhayiza zereththafe gidena. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Geesha maxaafay giza mala “Asho mayday wurikka maata malakko, Iza bonchoyka wurikka wora ciisha malako, Maatayka meles, ciishayka qoqopettes. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Goda qaalay gidiko medhinas eqqi dees” Intes sabakettida miishiracho qaalayka hessakko.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Deyo shuchune geesha dere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi iittateth wursi, baletho wursi, qoodhepe qommon hano, qaanateteth ayko qoommo zigiris intefe digite. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ha7i yelettida guutha nayti maath amotizayssa mala inteka attanas izan dicci dicci baanas geeshi gidida ayana timirtte laamotite. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Inte laamotanas bessizay Goday kiya gididayssa shaki erikokko. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi gede deyo shuchu gidida Yesusako shiiqite. He shuchay asay leqqi aggidayssa shin Xoossa achchan qass doorettidayssane boncho waagay dizaddekko. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Inte gede Goda Yesusako shiiqanayka deyo shucha mala Xiillo ayana duussaso gidana mala oothetista. Hessaththoka inte Yesus Kiristoosa baggara ufayssiza ayana yarsho Xoossas shiishanas geesha qeeseta gidandista. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Geesha maxaafan “Heko dooretida boncho gidida keethas kuriqunthan uttiza shuchu tani Xiyonen woththana. Izan ammanizadey yeelatena” giza qaalay xaafeti uttides. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi intes ammanizaytas he shuchay boncho shuchukko shin hinko izan ammanontaytas qass “Shuchan keexxiza keeththa hiillati leqqi wora yegidayss izi keeththa kurqunthas hu7e gidides” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Qasseka “Heko ase dhupiza shuchay hayssich! asa dhuphi kundisiza zaala shuchay hayssakko” gess. Istti qaala ammanontta ixxida gishshi dhuphetettes. kaseka istti hessas dizaytakko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Inte qass dhumape gede daro malalsiza iza po7oko xeeygida Xoossa malalsiza oothoza awajanas dooretida yeleteth, Kawo qeeseta Xoossi intena bees histida inte dumma derekko. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Inte kase Xoossa dere gidekista shin ha7i gidikko inte Xoossa derekko. Inte kase intes Xooss qadhetontta derekko shin ha7i gidikko qadhetides. <char style="rq"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hose 2.23</ref></char></para>
  <para style="s">Xoossa oothanchata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta siiqoto! inte hayssa alameza bolla imathene bete asi gidida gishshi shempora olettiza asho amotethatape haakana mala ta intena hadara gayss. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Oone erizay “Intena istti iittaa oothetes” giidi asay intena zigirikoka Xoossi nuna beyanas yiza gallas hanko dere asay inte oothoy lo7o gididayssa beyidi Xoossu galatana mala inte isttara diza wode inte amaley lo7o gido. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Inte Goda Yesusa gishshi giidi dere ayssizaytas azazetite. Kawoy qass wursofe bollara diza gishshi Kawosika azazetite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Dere ayssizaytas azazetite. Istti iitta oothizayta qaxxayanassine lo7o oothizadayta galatanas Kawope kiitettizaytakko. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Inte lo7o oothon hanko eray bayinda eyatethan hasa7izayta co7u histana mala hessika Xoossa shenekko. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Inte Xoossas oothiza asata mala gididi hirgay bayinda deyte attin inte inte shene mala diza duussa iittatetha kammiza miishe histopite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ase wursika bonchite. Ammanizayta siiqite. Xoossas babbite. Kawo bonchite.</para>
  <para style="s">Kiristoosa waayetetha lemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Inteno Asas oothi aqqizayto! intena oothisiza godatas bonchon azazetite. Inte azazistanay lo7otasine ashikistas xalala gidontta hanko iittatassarakko. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Asi galatettizay coo mela qohetishe hessika Xoossa gishshi giidi danda7ikokko. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Inte iitta oothida gishshi qaxayettishe danda7iko intes aaza galatay deyanee? Inte lo7o oothidi waaye ekkishe danda7iko inte Xoossafe galata ekkandista. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Inte xeeygettidayka hessaskko. Inte iza lemuso kaallana mala Kiristoosay inte gishshi waaye ekkidi intes lemuso gidides. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Izi aykko nagarakka oothibeyna. Iza duunan geney beettibeyna. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Asay iza cayshin izi zaari cayibeyna. Waayetishe bena tumu piridiza Godas hadara aathi immides attin halo kessana manddibeyna. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nuni nagarape shaakettidi xiillotethan daana mala izi berka ba ashon nu nagara masiqqale bolla tookides. Inte iza madunthan paxidista. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Inte dhayida dorisata mala coo mela tuuyru gidistako shin ha7i qass inte shempo heemmizayssakone naagizayssako simmidista.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Azina gishshine machi gishshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessaththoka macheto! inte inte azinatas azazetite. Hessatho issi issi azinati Xoossa qaala ammanonttayta gidikkoka coo mela ba machcheta lo7etethan xalala simmontta agettena. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Istti simmana danda7izay inte geeshatethane inte ase bonchiza duusu dizayssa beydikko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Inte lo7etethi coo mela hu7e dathanine worqan gexxetethan, al7o mayo mayon, coo mela ayfen beettiza geexen gidopo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Inte lo7oy Xoossa sinthan wagara diza keehi bonchetidazine dhayontta gexxen, ashiketethan, addatethanine ayanan gexxettida wozina garisan qoteti diza giddo wozina lo7eteth gido. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Beni wode ba ufayss Xoossan oothida geesha macashati gexxettiday hayssa malankko. Istti ba azinatas azazettida. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Istti azazetidaykka Saaray Abirame “Ta godo!” gaada azazettidayssa malakko. Inteka lo7o miishi oothikone issi iitta miishey intena daganthontta aggiko inte Saara naytakko. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Azinato! inte inte machchetara akekan issife deyte. Istti intefe daburancha medheteth gidida gishshine qasseka Xoossi coo mela kiyatethan immiza deyo istti intenara issife laatanayssa gishshi inte istta bonchite. Inte heyssatho oothiko inte woossa dhuphiza miishey deena.</para>
  <para style="s">lo7o oothiza gishshi waaye beyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessafe hara baggara qass inte issay issara siiqon diite. Hara ura bolla gakkiza meto inte meto mala xeellite. Inte inte garisan ishantta mala siiqettite. Ashikistane kiyata gidite. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Anjjite attin isttas iitta cashes, cashshe zaaropite. Inte xeeygetiday hessaththo oothid anjjo laatanaskko. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Geesha maxaafay giza mala “Deyon daana koyzayine lo7o gallasata beyanas koyiza uray ba duunape iitta hasa7ontta malane ba meterishatika gene hasa7ontta mala naageto. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Iitta yoope hakkone lo7o ootho; saroteth koyone kaallo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Goda ayfeti xiillota bagga xeelletes. Iza haythetika istta woossa siyanas doya deetes. Hinko iitta oothizayta qass Goday ba hanqo ayfeso bessana” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Inte lo7o oothanas miinetiko inte bolla iitta miishe gaathanay oonee? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Inte lo7o oothida gishshi waaye beykoka inte anjjo ekkana. Asay inte bolla iitta oothanas mandetizayssas babbofitene daro qopofite. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Goda Kiristoosa inte wozinan bonchitene iza inte deyos Goda histtite. Intes diza ufayssa gishshi intena oychizaytas wurisos malthe immanas wurso wode giigeti uttite. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Inte isttas immana malthey qass ashiketethanine bonchon gido. Inte Kiristoosayta gidida gishshi intes diza lo7o amaleza gishshi iitta hasa7iza asay ba iitta hasa7an yeellatana mala intes lo7o qopay deyo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Xoossa shene gidiko inte iitta ootho oothidi waayetanayssyafe lo7o ootho oothidi waayetiko lo7okko. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kiristoosayka nuna Xoossako shiishanas izi ba hu7es xiillokko shin hanko xiillo gidontta nu nagara gishshi nam7anthettontta mala issi to waayettidi hayqides. Izi ashon hayqides shin ayanan qass paxides. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hessa he ayanan qasho keeththan diza shempotako biidi isttas miishiracho qaala yootides. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Heyti heen woyne keeththan diza shempoti kase Nohe wode markabezi ootheti giigishin istti simmana mala Xoossi danda7an naagishin nuni nessi azazettokko gidaytakko. He markabezan gellin haathey istta ashidayta qooday osppun gidida guuthata asata xalalakko. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessi he haathezi ha7i qass inte izan attiza xinqatte lemusokko. Hayssi xinqattey qita bolla geeyanas meccetethi gidontta geesha qopa ekanas Xoossako shiishiza woossakko. Izi intena ashanayka Yesus Kiristoosa dentha baggarakko. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Izi pude salo biidi ha7i Xoossa achchan dees. kiitanchatine godatethi isttas dizayti wolqamataka izas haarettida.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Geeshatethan duus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kiristoosay ba ashon waaye ekkida gishshi inteka ola olettiza miishe gixxidade asa mala hayssa ha qofan minnidi giigettite. Be ashon waaye beyida uray nagara ootho aggides. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hessafe guye ba diza wode wurson izi daanay iitta asho amotethi oothon gidontta dishe Xoossa shene polonkko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hinko dere asati oothizayssa mala inte coo mela yeda duussan asho amon, mathon, wogape ogey bayinda kaassan, wogape aathi uyidi durusanine harassiza eeqa goynon kase inte athida wodezi intes gidana. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ha7i qass inte ha yoozan isttara wogay bayinda qixxi qixxontta gishshi istti malaletetesine intena cayettes. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Gido attin hayqidaytta bollane paxxa dizayta bolla pirdanas giigi uttidayssas istti malthe immana. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hayqidaytassara miishiracho qaalay yootetiday hessa gishikko. Hessaththoka ay asa bollaka piridiza mala istta asho bolla piridana. Istta shempoy qass Xooss diza mala deyon deyana.</para>
  <para style="s">Xooss imotata wogara go7eteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi wode wursethi mattides. Inte minni woossanas danda7ana mala wogara diitene wopu gida qofay intes deyo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Siiqoy daro nagara kammiza gishshi harape bollara inte inte garisan lo7ethi siiqettite. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Zuzunthi bayinda issay issa imathatethi mooki ekkite. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Duma duma gidida Xoossa kiyatetha imotata ammanetethan ayson intefe issi issi uray bees imettida Xoossa kiyatetha imotan hara ura maado. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Tamarisizadey Xoossa qaala tamarisiza mala tamariso. Hagazizadey Xoossi izas immiza wolqan hagazo. Hessa malan Xooss Yesus Kiristoosa baggara haniza wurson galattistana. Bonchoyne godateth medhinape medhina gakkanaas izas gido. Amin7i.</para>
  <para style="s">Meto danda7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta siiqoto! inte tama mala paaciza meto giddon gelliza wode hessa malay kase bayinda ooratha miishey gakidazi intes milatin malalettopite. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessafe bollara Kiristoosa bonchoy qoncciza wode inte keehi ufa7istana mala inte izara iza waayeza ekkizayta gidida mala ufa7etite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Inte Kiristoosa suntha gishshi cayettiko boncho ayanay hessika Xoossa ayanay inte bolla shempiza gishshi ufa7ettite. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Intefe oona bollaka metoy gakiko he uray shempo wodhida asa mala, kayso mala, iitta oothida asa mala, asa yoo giddo coo woxxi gelidada mala gidopo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Izi ammanizade gidida gishshi iza bolla gakiza metoy diiko qass Kirstoosa sunthan izi xoossu galato attin yeellatopo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Piriday doomistanas wodey matides. He piriday doomistanay koyro Xoossa asa bollakko. Histtin piriday nunan doommiko Xoossa mishiracho qaalas azazetontta ixxida asa wursethi aazi gidanee? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Geesha maxaafay giza mala “xiilloyka waaydi attanas gidiko, hanko Xoossas goynota asayine nagaranchati waanandetoo?” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi Xoossa shene mala waayetiza asati benatetha wurs ammanetida bena medhidayssas hadara immidi lo7o ootho oothontta aggofeto.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xoossa asa ayssanas immetida woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi taka isttara issife woossa keethas cimane kirstoosa waayezas marka gidida tani qasseka burope qonccana bonchoza gishettanas diza tani intenara diza woossa keeththa cimata zorays. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Intes hadara immetida Xoossa wude naagite. He iza wudeza wolqara gidontta Xoossi koyiza ogera dosara heemmitte. Miishes yiqetethan gidontta haggazanas wozinape koshan gido. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hesathoka inte hallafetetha garisan dizayta yeedhi haaron gidonta wudezas loo7o emuuso beson gido. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Inte hessaththo oothikko hanikko wanna heemmizayss qooncciza wode inte mooretontta boncho akilile ekkanayysako. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessaththoka inteno yeelagato! inte cimmatas azazetite. Inte wurikka ashiketethi afila mala maydi issay issas oothite. “Xooss otorizayta ixxes. Ashikkistass qasse ba kiyatethi immes” geeteti kasse geesha maxaafan xaafetides. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi Xooss ba woden dhoqu hisitana mala minno Xoossa kuushepe garssara intena ziqq histite. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Izi intes qopiza gishshi intena metiza qofa wurs iza bolla yeggite. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wogara deyte! beegite! inte morke Daabulosay bess mittana miishe koyshe xaagiza gaamo mala inte yuushon gaarmmames. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Alame kuumethan diza inte ishati hessa mala meto ekkana dizayssa inte eridi amanon minni eqqidi izara eqetite. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Inte guutha wodes waayetidayssafe guye intena Kiristosa baggara gede medhina bonchos xeeygida kiyatethi wursos Goday izi berka intena gakkida waayezape ashshana, maadanane minthethana qasseka dazigisana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bonchoyne wolqay medhinape medhina gakkanaas izas gido. Amin7i.</para>
  <para style="s">wursetha saroka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tani iza ammanetida ishakko ga qopizza Silase baggara hayssa kiittaza qanxxara intes xaafadis. Ta hessa xaafiday intena zooranasine hayssi tumu Xoossa kiyatethi gididaysa intes qonncissanas gaadakko. Hessa gishshi inte hayssan Xoossa kiyatethan miinni eqqite. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Inte mala dooretidara Babiloonen diza michcho gidida woossa keethaya intes saroka shiishawusu. Ta na Marqosayka intena sarokes. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ammano siiqotethan inte issay issa yeeri ekkidi saroketite. Intes kiristoosaytas wursos saroy gido.</para>
</usx>
